# Bot-generated transient artifacts. Routine outputs land in logs/
# (cycle JSON, runs.jsonl) and .claude/ holds PIR sync cache, DM
# bodies, intermediate Python helpers, settings.local.json. None
# are load-bearing for bot operation — they regenerate on next run.
# .claude/settings.local.json is user-local IDE config and shouldn't
# be committed.
.claude/
logs/
